From: Lukas Rieger <code@lukasrieger.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Make clean succeed before the first build

OpenEmbedded's default do_configure runs make clean. A fresh source tree
has no bluebinder executable yet, so plain rm fails and aborts configuration.

Upstream-Status: Pending

--- a/Makefile
+++ b/Makefile
@@ -18,5 +18,5 @@ install:
 	cp bluebinder $(DESTDIR)/usr/sbin
 
 clean:
-	rm bluebinder
+	$(RM) bluebinder
 
